<title>PHILIPPINES: Marsman 9-mth net 125.569 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Marsman 9-mth net 125.569 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmaceutical firm Marsman &amp; Co Inc said on Tuesday its net income for the first three quarters of the year reached 125.569 million pesos.</p>
<p>Revenues of the company totalled 9.64 billion pesos for the first nine months.</p>
<p>The company did not disclose comparative figures.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
